  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Southeast of the northern icy plain, at the extreme south of Meng tribe, he walks barefoot on autumn blade plain. He is a rank seven Gu Immortal who cultivates blade path at peak rank seven battle strength, a famous Northern Plains expert and one of Meng tribe’s pillars. His blade path sits at quasi-great grandmaster. He asked to stay on the plain to guard the edge Gu resource point and to imitate Ren Zu’s steps toward blade path great grandmaster.",
      "chapters": [
        1563
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_meng_tribe",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "gu_edge_immortal_gu",
        "char_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is tall and well-built with a bronze luster to his skin. He wears an armored vest that reveals his shoulders, rolls his pants up to show his calves, and walks barefoot, leaving bloody footprints on the silver blade soil without changing expression.",
      "chapters": [
        1563
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan intrudes and attacks. Meng Tu answers with blade path phantoms and an environment close to an immortal battlefield by influencing the plain’s dao marks. He uses heaven and earth blade, then loses its core Immortal Gu when Fang Yuan’s great thief ghost hand steals it, suffering serious backlash.",
      "chapters": [
        1564
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fight-on-autumn-blade-plain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After bladewing Immortal Gu is seized, he asks for mercy, then laughs that he is not a person who begs and self-detonates. Not even a corpse remains. Fang Yuan confirms he is dead. His blade path dao marks are engraved into autumn blade plain, and Fang Yuan fails to take his soul or immortal aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        1565
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_bladewing_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Meng Zi Zai and Meng Zhao learn his soul lantern is extinguished and that he died in battle; the tribe seals the news for stability.",
      "chapters": [
        1566
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_meng_zi_zai",
        "char_meng_zhao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sleeping Lady is told of the death and publicizes that Meng tribe could not find the culprit.",
      "chapters": [
        1568
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sleeping_lady"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After rebirth Fang Yuan again finds him on autumn blade plain as a blade path quasi-great grandmaster and one of the top three among Meng tribe’s rank seven elites. Fang Yuan traps him in yama battlefield and kills him with Luo Po seal before he can self-detonate, taking his intact body, aperture, three Immortal Gu, and drinking blade wine.",
      "chapters": [
        1752
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rebirth-timeline-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
